<text x="20" y="32" font-size="24" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">From signal to product</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Explanatory reconstruction</text>
<text x="62" y="110" font-size="21" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">01 · SIGNAL</text>
<text x="62" y="139" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Identifier, location, time</text>
